WEBVTT

00:00:00.799 --> 00:00:06.029
Hello. So we chose to rent our Tonal
because we were not sure yet if we wanted

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:09.139
to commit to the full big purchase.

00:00:09.319 --> 00:00:11.040
You can see it right back here, though.

00:00:11.079 --> 00:00:13.699
We decided to go ahead and give it a try.

00:00:14.199 --> 00:00:19.229
Having the discounted price offered and
having the ability to actually try it

00:00:19.239 --> 00:00:22.429
in home was helpful with, you
know, even our schedules,

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:25.009
being able to determine is this something
we can commit to in the morning?

00:00:25.019 --> 00:00:28.249
Is this something we, you know, will
know that we need to commit to at night?

00:00:28.259 --> 00:00:31.389
Or maybe we have to be
flexible with it at any point,

00:00:31.399 --> 00:00:33.130
depending on our schedule.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:36.650
We've regularly commented now we don't
have to go to the gym and fight for

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.269
parking and fight for equipment.

00:00:38.279 --> 00:00:41.239
So it has honestly been really awesome.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.849
I need to commit to using
it just a little bit more.

00:00:44.859 --> 00:00:49.150
Um, but we would love to get to the
point where we say we just outright buy

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.599
it, um, because we've had
such a good experience.
